        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Bommer 3029-6x4.5, 6\" x 4-1/2\" Double Acting Spring Hinge</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n6\" x 4-1/2\" Double Acting Spring Hinge. Mortise Type for use on <b>Hollow Metal Doors</b> (4-1/2\" Template Hole Pattern) - Door flange is mortised into edge of door. Jamb flange is surface applied to door jamb. For doors 1-3/4\" thick. Packaged with 12-24 x 1/2\" machine screws.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<!-- <p>\r\nAlso available : <a href=\"/products/6-x-4-1-2-template-mortise-double-acting-spring-hinge-with-ball-tips-pair-bommer-cl3029-6x4-5\">Bommer CL3029-6x4.5 6\" x 4-1/2\" Double Acting Spring Hinge with Ball Tips</a>\r\n</p> -->\r\n\r\n<!-- <p>\r\n<b>Note:</b> If standard hinge locations are furnished on 1-3/4\" hollow metal doors, Bommer recommends using <a href=\"/products/8-x-4-1-2-template-mortise-double-acting-spring-hinge-pair-bommer-3029-8x4-5\">Bommer 3029-8x4.5</a> for maximum support. <br>\r\nI.E.: If you are installing a <b>1-3/4\" thick metal door</b> that has <b>normal hinge locations</b> on it, use the larger  <a href=\"/products/8-x-4-1-2-template-mortise-double-acting-spring-hinge-pair-bommer-3029-8x4-5\">8\" x 4-1/2\" Template Pattern Spring Hinges</a>.\r\n</p> -->\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Bommer 3029-6x4.5 Double Acting Spring Hinge:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Steel</li>\r\n<li>Hinge Size: 6\"</li>\r\n<li>Template Door Leaf (4-1/2\" Template Pattern)</li>\r\n<li>Non-Handed</li>\r\n<li>Hinge Type: Mortise</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: <b>1-3/4\" Thick Doors</b></li>\r\n<li>Maximum Swing:  90º each direction</li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Zinc Plated</b></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/3029-6x45.pdf?v=1691094995\" target=\"new\"><b>Bommer 3029-6x4.5 Dimension Diagram (PDF)</b></a>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<!-- START Bommer 3029 -->\r\n<table width=\"600\" border=\"1\" bordercolor=\"#990000\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"special-items-table\">\r\n<tr height=\"30\">\r\n<td colspan=\"7\" align=\"center\" valign=\"middle\">\r\n    <span class=\"h-green\">Bommer 3029-6x4.5 Hinge Selection for Maximum Door Size</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr height=\"24\"> \r\n<td rowspan=\"2\" width=\"70\">Bommer Hinge Number</td>\r\n<td colspan=\"2\" width=\"170\">2 Hinges</td>\r\n<td colspan=\"2\" width=\"170\">3 Hinges</td>\r\n<td rowspan=\"2\" width=\"130\">Door Thickness</td>\r\n<td rowspan=\"2\" width=\"50\">Min. Door Height</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td  width=\"85\">Door Weight</td>\r\n<td  width=\"85\">Door Width</td>\r\n<td  width=\"85\">Door Weight</td>\r\n<td  width=\"85\">Door Width</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr height=\"40\" bgcolor=\"#eeeeee\">\r\n<td>3029-6x4.5</td>\r\n<td>75 lbs</td>\r\n<td>2'-8\"</td>\r\n<td>107 lbs</td>\r\n<td>3'-0\"</td>\r\n<td>1-3/4\"</td>\r\n<td>7'-0\"</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr height=\"30\">\r\n<td colspan=\"7\"><span class=\"text\"><b>Note:</b> Do Not use on Doors with Hinge Edge Beveled.</span>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</table>\r\n</p><!-- END Bommer 3029 -->\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Sold as a Pair (2 Hinges).</b>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<br><br><br><br>\r\n<b>** This item is Discontinued.  <a href=\"/products/6-x-4-1-2-template-mortise-double-acting-spring-hinge-pair-pbb-da816045\">See available direct fit replacement PBB-DA816045</a>.</b>\r\n<br><br>\r\n</p>",
